{"shortDescription":"Montreal, Quebec--(Newsfile Corp. - September 16, 2026) - Bullion Gold Discoveries Corp. TSXV:BGD (\"Bullion\" or the \"Company\") is pleased to announce the launch of surface exploration programs at its BODO and Langlade projects, located respectively 200 km north of Chibougamau and 110 km east of Sen…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Montreal, Quebec--(Newsfile Corp. - September 16, 2026) - ",{"type":"b","children":["Bullion Gold Discoveries Corp."]}," ",{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TSXV:BGD","text":"TSXV:BGD"}}," "]},"(\"",{"type":"b","children":["Bullion"]},"\" or the \"",{"type":"b","children":["Company"]},"\") is pleased to announce the launch of surface exploration programs at its BODO and Langlade projects, located respectively 200 km north of Chibougamau and 110 km east of Senneterre, in Québec."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Program Highlights:"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":["BODO project - Rivon Lake area: stripping, rock sampling, channel sampling and geological mapping;"]},{"type":"*","children":["Langlade project - North East area: soil sampling and large till (\u003e10kg) sampling;"]},{"type":"*","children":["Field crews are mobilized with the programs expected to run through September 28th, 2026."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["About the LANGLADE Project"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["The Langlade project (74 claims - 4,127 ha), formerly named Cadillac Extension, is located approximately 110 km east of the municipality of Senneterre, Québec and is accessible year-round via a well-developed forest road network. The geological setting is highly prospective for Volcanogenic Massive Sulphide (\"VMS\") deposits."]},{"type":"p","children":["In October 2025, Bullion collected a 5 kg till sample which, following hydraulic concentration, ",{"type":"b","children":["revealed several dozens of coarse gold gr