vals with target grades greater than 1.00% Cu-Zn using Na₂O₂ fusion with ICP-OES or ICP-MS finish. Preparation duplicates, certified reference standards, and blanks are inserted into the sample stream."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Qualified Person"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["The scientific and technical information disclosed in this news release has been reviewed and approved by Ms. Suzie Tremblay, a member in good standing of the Ordre des géologues du Québec (OGQ No. 10664), who is a \"Qualified Person\" within the meaning of National Instrument 43-101 - Standards of Disclosure for Mineral Projects. All geoscientific activities related to the BODO Project and the Langlade Project are carried out under the supervision of Ms. Suzie Tremblay, Vice-President of Explo-Logik."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["About Bullion Gold Discoveries Corp."]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Bullion Gold Discoveries Corp. ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TSXV:BGD","text":"TSXV:BGD"}}," is a Québec-focused mineral exploration company advancing a portfolio of gold and polymetallic projects located in some of the province's most prospective mining districts. The Company's strategy is centered on creating shareholder value through discovery success by applying modern geological interpretation, disciplined exploration practices and strategic partnerships."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company holds a 100% interest in the Terragold (Au), Langlade (Cu, Zn, Au, Ag), and Bodo (Cu, Zn, Au, Ag) projects. The Bousquet (Au) project is under option to Olympio Metals ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"ASX:OLY","text":"ASX:OLY"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["Additional information is available on the Company's website ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://api.newsfilecorp.com/redirect/wEX0RHaXOQ","linkText":"bulliongold.ca"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["For further information, please contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","child